Template functions
==================

The template sandbox (internal/templates, ADR-0012) uses the function registries of sprout
(https://github.com/go-sprout/sprout), licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (C) 2013-2020 Masterminds, as a
library dependency of the shipped binary; no sprout code is copied. Alertmanager's template functions are
re-implemented under their Alertmanager names from their documented behaviour; no Alertmanager code is copied.
